The position will lead the resumption and strengthening of physiotherapy services in rehabilitation centres across North Darfur and through mobile service delivery integrated within Primary Health Care Centres (PHCCs). Additionally, the Technical Officer will provide technical support and capacity-building opportunities for physiotherapists, rehabilitation personnel, and other healthcare workers to strengthen the quality and accessibility of rehabilitation services. The role will also contribute to the assessment of the physical rehabilitation sector in Sudan, identifying service gaps, needs, challenges, and opportunities to inform programme development and strategic interventions.

